  <LichPhylactery.LP_SubclassDef>
    <defName>LP_Sub_EldritchKnight</defName>
    <label>奥法骑士</label>
    <description>剑与法术。有自己的法力（上限 1 + 战士等级 ÷ 3，睡觉、研究时恢复，醒着也慢慢回），用来放战争戏法；绑定的武器不会被缴械，还能召回到手里。</description>
    <parent>LP_Class_Fighter</parent><order>1</order><emblem>LP/Classes/Subclass/Emblem_EldritchKnight</emblem><color>(0.55,0.5,0.95)</color>
    <abilities><li><ability>LP_EK_WeaponBond</ability><level>3</level></li><li><ability>LP_EK_Shield</ability><level>3</level></li><li><ability>LP_EK_ThunderBlade</ability><level>3</level></li><li><ability>LP_EK_AbsorbElements</ability><level>3</level></li>
