  </LichPhylactery.LP_SubclassDef>
  <LichPhylactery.LP_SubclassDef>
    <defName>LP_Sub_PsiWarrior</defName>
    <label>灵能战士</label>
    <description>用心灵之力打仗。有灵能器时能力不耗斗志、改加神经热（神经热放不下时照常耗斗志）；没有灵能器就只耗斗志。效果乘心灵敏感度。</description>
    <parent>LP_Class_Fighter</parent><order>2</order><emblem>LP/Classes/Subclass/Emblem_PsiWarrior</emblem><color>(0.45,0.85,0.9)</color>
    <abilities><li><ability>LP_PW_PsionicStrike</ability><level>3</level></li><li><ability>LP_PW_ProtectiveField</ability><level>3</level></li><li><ability>LP_PW_TeleJump</ability><level>3</level></li>
      <li><ability>LP_PW_PsiAdept</ability><level>7</level></li><li><ability>LP_PW_Shove</ability><level>7</level></li><li><ability>LP_PW_GuardianField</ability><level>11</level></li><li><ability>LP_PW_TeleStorm</ability><level>15</level></li></abilities>
  </LichPhylactery.LP_SubclassDef>
  <LichPhylactery.LP_SubclassDef>
    <defName>LP_Sub_Hemomancy</defName>
    <label>血咒学派</label>
    <description>以血代法：血咒法术不耗法力，而是让自己失血（失血到 45% 就不能再施；血族改扣血原质）。自己伤得越重，血咒伤害越高（最多 +30%）。巫妖和不死者没有血，不能选。</description>
    <parent>LP_Class_Wizard</parent><order>1</order><emblem>LP/Classes/Subclass/Emblem_Hemomancy</emblem><color>(0.8,0.2,0.25)</color>
    <abilities><li><ability>LP_HM_BloodSpear</ability><level>3</level></li><li><ability>LP_HM_BloodBind</ability><level>3</level></li><li><ability>LP_HM_FleshShaping</ability><level>7</level></li><li><ability>LP_HM_Siphon</ability><level>7</level></li>
